/* book exam traps: Compression ratio is not Vs/Vc. The charge starts in the whole volume at BDC, Vs + Vc, and ends in Vc; the slip gives 7.20 instead of 8.20 in the example. | A bore of 80 mm is 8.0 cm, not 80 cm. Put the bore and the stroke in the same unit before you square and multiply. | Stroke is twice the crank radius, not the crank radius. | Swept volume is one cylinder; displacement is all cylinders. Read which one the question asks for. | mep needs Vs in m³ to give pascals. Feed it cm³ and the answer is a million times too small. */
